WEBVTT

00:09.617 --> 00:12.957
Wind Style:
Massive Rasen Shuriken!

00:14.497 --> 00:17.377
Inferno Style:
Susano'o Flame Control!

00:24.177 --> 00:27.017
<i>No... That's not what I meant.</i>

00:29.477 --> 00:35.277
<i>Only "Wind" can assist</i>
<i>and magnify "Fire..."</i>

00:49.957 --> 00:51.037
Burn away!

00:54.287 --> 00:58.047
You heard what
Sasuke said earlier, didn't you?

00:59.007 --> 01:01.127
What are his true intentions?

01:09.807 --> 01:10.977
I have no idea.

01:29.827 --> 01:31.077
Though still incomplete,

01:31.157 --> 01:33.917
the Ten Tails has been revived
and is battling the Allied Forces.

01:33.997 --> 01:36.167
So I think that it's become
quite a complex situation.

01:37.127 --> 01:38.207
It's gotten that bad...

01:40.417 --> 01:43.337
In that case, we need to hurry!

01:43.677 --> 01:45.797
I'll carry everyone with my sand.

01:46.347 --> 01:47.967
Please save your chakra.

01:48.427 --> 01:51.517
We came in mid-story.
I want more details!

01:51.887 --> 01:53.847
Ask about them while we're en route.

01:54.307 --> 01:57.317
Let's go as fast as we can...
to the battlefield!

