03:29.447 --> 03:34.077
Kakashi vs. Obito

03:45.047 --> 03:49.177
Then why do you work with Sasuke?

03:52.807 --> 03:55.977
Because I exist to protect him.

03:59.557 --> 04:03.567
Sasuke! There are other Tailed Beasts
inside that huge one!

04:03.777 --> 04:06.237
Once it's weakened,
shut off your Black Flames!

04:06.397 --> 04:08.487
Then Kurama and I will
pull them out of it!

04:08.647 --> 04:09.567
No.

04:10.157 --> 04:11.657
They all burn.

04:12.777 --> 04:14.697
Hey! Don't you get it?

04:14.787 --> 04:16.407
If we don't save them now,

04:16.497 --> 04:18.917
we'll end up facing
a lot of trouble later on!

04:20.247 --> 04:24.587
<i>I'm going to put an end to</i>
<i>this failing system currently in place!</i>

04:27.877 --> 04:29.587
<i>And then, a new...</i>

04:42.647 --> 04:45.067
<i>It detached the piece of itself</i>
<i>that was on fire!</i>

04:54.367 --> 04:57.577
Sakura... Can I ask you something?

04:59.787 --> 05:03.417
Since I don't know him very well,
I can look at this objectively.

05:04.287 --> 05:07.087
Sasuke cannot be trusted
as a true comrade.

05:08.087 --> 05:11.127
What are your true feelings
on the matter, Sakura?

05:14.347 --> 05:17.717
Don't worry,
Sasuke has come back to us.

05:18.597 --> 05:23.057
I'm happy about that.
And I do trust him.

05:25.687 --> 05:28.147
<i>Your words may not be lies...</i>

05:29.487 --> 05:30.437
<i>But...</i>

05:31.697 --> 05:35.947
<i>I can already tell that</i>
<i>your smile is fake.</i>

05:39.867 --> 05:41.787
What's up, Shikamaru?

05:44.327 --> 05:45.417
It's nothing...

06:10.647 --> 06:11.607
Obito...

06:12.237 --> 06:13.907
Enough of these tricks...

06:14.657 --> 06:16.067
I'm over it.

06:20.077 --> 06:21.577
No more genjutsu.

06:24.037 --> 06:28.087
Looks like I can't find anything
that will change you.

06:31.167 --> 06:34.047
Right now, all I can give you...

06:35.717 --> 06:36.927
... is death.

06:39.927 --> 06:42.307
Then I shall do the same.

06:44.387 --> 06:45.097
Come!

06:53.437 --> 06:54.317
<i>All right!</i>

06:54.397 --> 06:55.657
<i>Shinobi Hand-to-Hand Combat!</i>

06:57.277 --> 06:57.947
<i>Begin!</i>

08:31.787 --> 08:32.667
I'm going to borrow this.

08:39.427 --> 08:40.337
<i>Fire Style...</i>

08:40.627 --> 08:42.297
<i>Fireball Jutsu!</i>

08:45.057 --> 08:45.887
<i>Earth Style...</i>

08:45.967 --> 08:47.177
<i>Mud Wall!</i>

09:21.087 --> 09:22.757
<i>The real one is here!</i>

09:43.697 --> 09:46.827
<i>Hand-to-hand combat is over.</i>
<i>Kakashi wins.</i>

09:47.657 --> 09:49.577
<i>Now perform the Unison Sign.</i>

10:00.547 --> 10:01.797
<i>Obito...</i>

10:01.877 --> 10:05.637
<i>Your once strong will is</i>
<i>still alive today, right next to me!</i>

10:06.757 --> 10:10.927
<i>What the current me can do</i>
<i>is protect the current Naruto!</i>

10:13.767 --> 10:15.187
<i>You will...</i>

10:16.057 --> 10:22.647
<i>Actually, everyone will</i>
<i>eventually end up just like me.</i>

10:26.117 --> 10:30.487
<i>Sasuke is a Rogue Ninja.</i>
<i>Standard procedure is to erase him.</i>

10:31.247 --> 10:33.867
<i>I'll bring back Sasuke!</i>

10:33.957 --> 10:36.627
<i>Someone who can't even save</i>
<i>one of their friends</i>

10:36.707 --> 10:38.667
<i>could never become Hokage!</i>

10:38.877 --> 10:42.837
<i>I'm going to surpass every Hokage</i>
<i>who came before me!</i>

10:43.167 --> 10:46.677
- <i>I'd never kill any of my friends!</i>
- <i>I'd never kill any of my friends!</i>

10:47.797 --> 10:50.717
<i>Naruto... You never waver.</i>

10:52.097 --> 10:53.887
<i>You're stronger than me and</i>

10:53.977 --> 10:55.687
<i>you have many things</i>
<i>that are solely yours.</i>

10:56.767 --> 10:58.937
<i>This is all I can do right now.</i>

11:00.517 --> 11:03.107
<i>And that is...</i>

11:04.607 --> 11:08.367
<i>to protect this world, my comrades...</i>

11:10.327 --> 11:12.827
<i>and the Obito of the past...</i>

11:13.827 --> 11:15.657
<i>by killing...</i>

11:19.667 --> 11:21.247
<i>the current Obito!</i>

12:10.337 --> 12:13.347
It's over, Obito.

12:23.267 --> 12:25.727
I'll let you win...

12:27.187 --> 12:30.567
this battle.

12:31.697 --> 12:34.907
But I'm not conceding the war!

12:54.887 --> 12:58.347
I thought I told you.
I have no intention of fighting a clone.

12:59.227 --> 13:02.857
You can come at me with them,
but they offer no resistance at all.

13:03.437 --> 13:06.357
You're concentrating too much power
in your actual body.

13:09.697 --> 13:13.817
Madara... All the time, you kept
holding something back...

13:18.447 --> 13:19.157
That's...

13:28.167 --> 13:31.177
<i>Looks like that's of no use</i>
<i>to me anymore.</i>

13:31.877 --> 13:36.217
<i>I wanted to fight Hashirama</i>
<i>before I became a Jinchuriki...</i>

13:37.057 --> 13:38.517
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

13:46.187 --> 13:47.727
<i>M-My body!</i>

13:49.487 --> 13:53.197
<i>It's time to make him bring me back</i>
<i>with Rinne Rebirth!</i>

14:26.977 --> 14:27.817
<i>That's...!</i>

14:34.197 --> 14:35.357
Obito...

14:36.237 --> 14:40.577
You're just a backup that
I had cultivated for my rebirth.

14:41.577 --> 14:43.457
<i>You saved me, Gramps?</i>

14:45.117 --> 14:46.037
<i>Thank you.</i>

14:46.707 --> 14:49.247
<i>It's too early to thank me.</i>

14:49.627 --> 14:52.417
<i>I intend to have you...</i>

14:52.507 --> 14:54.047
... repay your debt.

14:54.377 --> 14:56.507
That time is now.

15:00.677 --> 15:03.137
<i>He's being controlled by</i>
<i>Madara's chakra!</i>

15:08.357 --> 15:10.067
<i>The Six Paths Forbidden...</i>

15:10.317 --> 15:12.357
<i>Rinne Rebirth Jutsu?</i>

15:13.317 --> 15:16.857
<i>Madara... He must not be allowed</i>
<i>to fully return to life!</i>

15:17.987 --> 15:19.197
Lads!

15:19.277 --> 15:20.867
You're all closer!

15:20.947 --> 15:23.697
Stop the jutsu of the one
on top of the Ten Tails right now!

