Is this also the best I can do?

15:58.947 --> 16:00.697
We'll just have to make do with this!

16:02.947 --> 16:07.617
They can't get to Obito in time,
so they're going to attack me...

16:08.917 --> 16:13.297
They should know by now
that I can't be stopped with clones.

16:24.717 --> 16:27.017
That's enough, Aoda!
You can get out of here!

16:28.017 --> 16:29.727
Yes, Lord Sasuke!

17:31.327 --> 17:34.627
<i>You won't always be</i>
<i>like this either, right?</i>

17:35.287 --> 17:36.377
<i>Don't give up.</i>

17:39.167 --> 17:41.837
<i>You love Rin, don't you?</i>

17:46.347 --> 17:48.057
<i>We'll both become Hokage.</i>

17:51.137 --> 17:52.977
<i>Right, Obito?</i>

18:01.817 --> 18:03.157
Sensei...

18:05.817 --> 18:06.737
Obito!

18:15.077 --> 18:18.247
That... was you?

18:31.807 --> 18:32.977
Which one is he?

18:36.017 --> 18:37.147
What a failure!

18:38.607 --> 18:40.777
But... oh well!

18:41.987 --> 18:42.857
Did they succeed?!

18:43.197 --> 18:45.357
That's Lord Fourth Hokage!

18:48.867 --> 18:51.367
<i>He teleported a Shadow Clone.</i>

18:52.407 --> 18:54.327
<i>Had he marked him already?</i>

19:00.297 --> 19:02.917
A Flying Raijin marking
never disappears.

19:04.337 --> 19:07.217
I didn't teach you that, did I, Obito?

19:12.557 --> 19:14.267
<i>If you were alive,</i>

19:14.387 --> 19:16.437
<i>I would have wanted you</i>
<i>to become Hokage...</i>

19:17.187 --> 19:18.307
